   different principles (hazard-generating process vs. terminal
   integrity state).

   THEREFORE: Prop. C.4 supplies only a SUFFICIENT condition for a
   granularity improvement. It does NOT prove that mechanism-indexing
   beats the eight-class partition. That claim is H1 and is settled
   ONLY by experiment E1 — never by this diagram.
